{%- comment -%}
  Renders: an AYUM line icon, drawn on a 30×30 grid with a 2px round stroke in currentColor.
  Source: Figma "How we freeze-dry" step icons (desktop 2001:270 / 2001:281 / 2001:292; the mobile
  2001:789 / 2001:813 / 2001:822 are the same drawings at 22px). The snowflake is Figma's six arrow
  arms (2001:293–2001:308) rotated 60° apart around the centre.
  Accepts:
  - icon: 'snowflake' | 'drop' | 'jar' | 'factory' | 'noheat' | 'shield' | 'truck'
  The last four ("Why choose AYUM", Figma 1:1007 / 55:730: Icon / factory, noheat, shield, truck) are drawn
  on a 26×26 grid with a 1.84px stroke, as in Figma.
  Usage: {% render 'ayum-icons', icon: 'snowflake' %}
  The SVG is decorative (aria-hidden); size it with CSS width (height follows the viewBox).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case icon -%}
  {%- when 'snowflake' -%}
    <svg class="ayum-icon ayum-icon--snowflake" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 15.75V4.25M12.75 6.5 15 4.25l2.25 2.25"/><path d="M15 15.75V4.25M12.75 6.5 15 4.25l2.25 2.25" transform="rotate(60 15 15)"/><path d="M15 15.75V4.25M12.75 6.5 15 4.25l2.25 2.25" transform="rotate(120 15 15)"/><path d="M15 15.75V4.25M12.75 6.5 15 4.25l2.25 2.25" transform="rotate(180 15 15)"/><path d="M15 15.75V4.25M12.75 6.5 15 4.25l2.25 2.25" transform="rotate(240 15 15)"/><path d="M15 15.75V4.25M12.75 6.5 15 4.25l2.25 2.25" transform="rotate(300 15 15)"/></g></svg>
  {%- when 'drop' -%}
